Significance: minor
Type: added

Close RSVPs for events that have been canceled. New RSVPs and status changes are refused, and reminder emails are not sent. The RSVP block gets an editable Canceled template, a disabled "Canceled" button by default, and the RSVP Form gets a "When Event Is Canceled" visibility setting with a canceled notice in its default template. Blocks saved before this show a default canceled button or notice.
